 the register found"}, {971124, "Elsbeth Vale spoken with"}, {971125, "The register restored at the lectern"}}}, [13] = {971101}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971103] = {[1] = "The Weight of Faith", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971102}}, [4] = 8, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Visit the three places Corven Dusk has marked with a candle in Brill, keep the darkhounds off him at the wayside shrine on the west road, recover the Agamand family's relic from their house at Agamand Mills, then answer Corven's question at the meeting house."}, [10] = {{{971126, "Places of the teachings visited"}, {1547, "Darkhounds driven from the wayside shrine"}, {971127, "The Agamand family's relic"}, {971128, "Corven's question answered"}}}, [13] = {971102}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971104] = {[1] = "The Bell for the Forgotten", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971101}}, [4] = 8, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Find the chapel's hidden bell in the barn at Garren's Haunt and its clapper in the farmhouse there, have the bell mended at Brill's smithy, hang it at the meeting house, and attend the chapel's opening with Dark Cleric Mirelle Vane."}, [10] = {{{971129, "The bell and its clapper recovered"}, {971130, "The bell mended at Brill's smithy"}, {971131, "The bell hung"}, {971132, "The chapel's opening attended"}}}, [13] = {971103}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971105] = {[1] = "Names to Remember", [2] = {{971107}}, [3] = {{971107}}, [4] = 8, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Recover 3 lost grave records from the graves around Tirisfal: Brill's north graveyard, Cold Hearth Manor, Garren's Haunt and Agamand Mills."}, [10] = {{{971133, "Lost grave records recovered"}}}, [13] = {971104}, [17] = 85, [23] = 4096, [24] = 1}, [971200] = {[1] = "More Than Ashes", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971200}}, [4] = 8, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Inspect the old customs office on Stillhome Lane and its flooded cellar, recover 5 surviving books from the abandoned Garren farm at Garren's Haunt, retrieve the office's record chest, and obtain Magistrate Sevren's permission to convert the property."}, [10] = {{{971214, "The office and its flooded cellar inspected"}, {971215, "Surviving books recovered"}, {971216, "The office's record chest"}, {971217, "Magistrate Sevren's permission"}}}, [13] = nil, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971201] = {[1] = "Shelves for the Dead", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971201}}, [4] = 8, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Gather 8 pieces of hardwood from the dead oaks west of Brill, get hinges and brackets from Rudd Carver at the builder's yard and repairable parchment from Abigail Shiel, then help Tobias Wren assemble the first shelves and mend the cellar window."}, [10] = {{{971218, "Seasoned hardwood"}, {971219, "Hinges and brackets from the builder's yard"}, {971220, "Repairable parchment from Abigail Shiel"}, {971221, "Shelves assembled and the cellar window mended"}}}, [13] = {971200}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971202] = {[1] = "The Names We Carried", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971202}}, [4] = 8, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Obtain the surviving census records from Royal Overseer Bauhaus in the Undercity, recover the Agamand mill's ledger from the barn at Agamand Mills, then record the memories of Thomas Arlento, Mrs. Winters and Doreen Beltis in Brill."}, [10] = {{{971222, "The Undercity's census records"}, {971223, "The Agamand mill's ledger"}, {971224, "Residents' memories recorded"}}}, [13] = {971201}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971203] = {[1] = "The Missing Chapter", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971200}}, [4] = 9, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Search the Scarlet Crusade's record store in the barn at Solliden Farmstead, deal with the Scarlet collectors there, recover the Cinderford chronicle's missing pages, and reassemble the chronicle at Edmund Rook's worktable in Brill."}, [10] = {{{971225, "The Scarlet record store searched"}, {971206, "Scarlet Collectors"}, {971226, "The chronicle's missing pages"}, {971227, "The chronicle reassembled and its last entry read"}}}, [13] = {971202}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971204] = {[1] = "An Open Book", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971200}}, [4] = 9, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Deliver Edmund Rook's invitations to Hamlin Atkins, Innkeeper Renee, Executor Zygand and Faruza, help Tobias Wren finish the reading table and sort 6 books into their collections, donate a recovered artifact, then attend the library's opening."}, [10] = {{{971228, "Invitations delivered"}, {971229, "The last reading table finished"}, {971230, "Books sorted into their collections"}, {971231, "A recovered artifact donated"}}}, [13] = {971203}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971205] = {[1] = "Lost Pages", [2] = {{971207}}, [3] = {{971207}}, [4] = 8, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Recover 3 lost documents from the abandoned places of Tirisfal: the barns at Garren's Haunt and Agamand Mills, the farmhouse at Solliden Farmstead and the sheds behind Cold Hearth Manor."}, [10] = {{{971232, "Lost documents recovered"}}}, [13] = {971204}, [17] = 85, [23] = 4096, [24] = 1}, [971300] = {[1] = "A Patch of Earth", [2] = {{971300}}, [3] = {{971300}}, [4] = 8, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Pull 6 patches of blighted weeds and shift 4 piles of rubble on Holt's Rise, Brill's eastern edge, take soil from Edda's 3 marker stakes to Pellen Moss, then return to Edda Graves."}, [10] = {{{971314, "Blighted weeds pulled"}, {971315, "Rubble shifted"}, {971316, "Soil taken from the stakes"}, {971317, "Pellen Moss's assessment"}}}, [13] = {971000}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971301] = {[1] = "What Takes Root", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971301}}, [4] = 8, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Lift 6 gravebloom seedlings from between the stones of Brill's cemetery, take a pale spore cap from the grove east of the garden and silt and water from the shore of Brightwater Lake, then plant and water Edda's 3 beds. Return to Pellen Moss."}, [10] = {{{971318, "Gravebloom seedlings lifted"}, {971319, "Pale spore cap"}, {971320, "Brightwater silt and water"}, {971321, "Beds planted and watered"}}}, [13] = {971300}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971302] = {[1] = "The Garden's Hunger", [2] = {{971300}}, [3] = {{971300}}, [4] = 9, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Inspect 3 cracked sections of Holt's old drain running from the Stillgarden down to the stream, kill 6 Bloated Drain Toads nesting at its mouth, clear the outlet, and help Pellen Moss mix a treatment for the soil. Then return to Edda Graves."}, [10] = {{{971322, "Cracked drain inspected"}, {971313, ""}, {971323, "Drain outlet cleared"}, {971324, "Soil treatment mixed with Pellen"}}}, [13] = {971301}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971303] = {[1] = "A Bloom for Every Memory", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971300}}, [4] = 9, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Ask three of Brill's townsfolk what flowers they remember, take seeds from the old kitchen garden behind Cold Hearth Manor and a moonpetal lily from the shore of Brightwater Lake, and help Willa Fen plant the memorial bed. Then speak with Edda Graves."}, [10] = {{{971325, "Townsfolk's flowers remembered"}, {971326, "Seeds from Cold Hearth Manor"}, {971327, "Moonpetal lily"}, {971328, "Memorial bed planted"}}}, [13] = {971302}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971304] = {[1] = "The First Harvest", [2] = {{971300}}, [3] = {{971300}}, [4] = 9, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Cut the 3 ripe herbs in the Stillgarden's glasshouse, set out Pellen Moss's stall, lay Edda's bouquet on the plague graves at the north end of the cemetery and invite Hamlin Atkins, Abigail Shiel and Junior Apothecary Holland, then answer Edda's question."}, [10] = {{{971329, "Ripe herbs cut"}, {971330, "Pellen's stall set out"}, {971331, "Bouquet laid and guests invited"}, {971332, "Edda's question answered"}}}, [13] = {971303}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971305] = {[1] = "A Garden Is Kept", [2] = {{971300}}, [3] = {{971300}}, [4] = 9, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Tend 4 of the Stillgarden's beds and cut 3 ripe herbs in the glasshouse, then return to Edda Graves."}, [10] = {{{971333, "Beds tended"}, {971334, "Ripe herbs cut"}}}, [13] = {971304}, [17] = 85, [23] = 4096, [24] = 1}, [971400] = {[1] = "Holding Together", [2] = {{971400}}, [3] = {{971400}}, [4] = 8, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Speak with the three injured travellers in Surgeon Elspeth Rane's care, get linen from Mrs. Winters and splints from Rudd Carver at the builder's yard, recover her instruments from the wagon she left on the Undercity road, and look into the vacant farmhouse by the cemetery gate. Then return to Elspeth."}, [10] = {{{971418, "Injured travellers spoken with"}, {971419, "Linen and splints"}, {971420, "Surgical instruments recovered"}, {971421, "Vacant farmhouse inspected"}}}, [13] = {971000}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971401] = {[1] = "A Steady Hand", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971400}}, [4] = 8, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Recover 2 oak tables from the yard at Garren's Haunt, get needles and thread from Abigail Shiel and glass and cleaning spirit from Junior Apothecary Holland, and put together the cabinets by the farmhouse door. Then report to Surgeon Elspeth Rane."}, [10] = {{{971422, "Oak tables recovered"}, {971423, "Needles and thread"}, {971424, "Glass and cleaning spirit"}, {971425, "Medical cabinets put together"}}}, [13] = {971400}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971402] = {[1] = "A Spare Arm and a Leg", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971401}}, [4] = 9, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Salvage 3 articulated joints from the rusted mill gearing at Agamand Mills, get leather straps and gears from Rudd Carver at the builder's yard, find the hand in the burned clockmaker's shop at Agamand Mills, then help Timm Vetch put his prosthetic together and test it."}, [10] = {{{971426, "Articulated joints salvaged"}, {971427, "Leather straps and gears"}, {971428, "The clockmaker's hand"}, {971429, "Prosthetic assembled and tested"}}}, [13] = {971401}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971403] = {[1] = "The Patient Comes First", [2] = {{971400}}, [3] = {{971400}}, [4] = 9, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Read the Royal Apothecary Society's proposal and Elspeth's case records, ask the three patients in the tent what they make of it, consult Apothecary Johaan, then help Surgeon Elspeth Rane write the hall's charter."}, [10] = {{{971430, "Proposal and case records read"}, {971431, "Patients consulted"}, {971432, "Apothecary Johaan consulted"}, {971433, "The patients' charter written"}}}, [13] = {971402}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971404] = {[1] = "The First Patient", [2] = {{971400}}, [3] = {{971406}}, [4] = 9, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Prepare the examination table, help Fenwick Pike clean and splint Agnes Morrow's leg, help Timm Vetch fit her brace and hand Surgeon Elspeth Rane her instruments through the operation. Then visit Agnes in the ward once she's recovered."}, [10] = {{{971434, "Examination table prepared"}, {971435, "Agnes's leg cleaned and splinted"}, {971436, "Brace fitted with Timm"}, {971437, "Instruments handed to Elspeth"}}}, [13] = {971403}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971405] = {[1] = "Repairs Required", [2] = {{971400}}, [3] = {{971400}}, [4] = 9, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Get clean linen from Mrs. Winters and thread from Abigail Shiel, close Deathguard Dillinger's shoulder and stitch Hamlin Atkins's hand, then return to Surgeon Elspeth Rane."}, [10] = {{{971438, "Linen from Mrs. Winters"}, {971439, "Thread from Abigail Shiel"}, {971440, "Deathguard Dillinger's shoulder closed"}, {971441, "Hamlin Atkins's hand stitched"}}}, [13] = {971404}, [17] = 85, [23] = 4096, [24] = 1}, [971500] = {[1] = "The Road Isn't Empty", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971500}}, [4] = 10, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Interview three caravan drivers stranded on the Undercity road, inspect the road and two broken supply wagons, ask Magistrate Sevren about a caravan office, and mark a site for it beside the road. Then return to Quartermaster Irena Sable."}, [10] = {{{971531, "Caravan drivers interviewed"}, {971532, "Road and broken wagons inspected"}, {971533, "Magistrate Sevren consulted"}, {971534, "Caravan office site marked"}}}, [13] = nil, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971501] = {[1] = "A Place to Unload", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971502}}, [4] = 10, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Recover 6 dumped shipping crates along the Undercity road south of Brill, get a loading winch from Rudd Carver at the builder's yard, timber from the yard and iron fittings from Abe Winters by Brill's smithy, then help Dren Hollow raise the loading platform and stow the crates in the big tent."}, [10] = {{{971535, "Dumped shipping crates recovered"}, {971536, "Loading winch from Rudd Carver"}, {971537, "Timber and iron fittings gathered"}, {971538, "Loading platform raised and crates stowed"}}}, [13] = {971500}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971502] = {[1] = "The Missing Manifest", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971500}}, [4] = 10, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Search the abandoned wagon on the Undercity road south of Brill and recover 3 missing shipping records, follow the trail to the bandits' camp on the hill west of the road, kill Bartle Kemp and recover Brill's cargo. Find out who altered the manifest, then settle it with Quartermaster Irena Sable."}, [10] = {{{971539, "Missing shipping records recovered"}, {971512, ""}, {971540, "Brill's stolen cargo recovered"}, {971541, "The altered manifest settled"}}}, [13] = {971501}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971503] = {[1] = "Licenses and Liabilities", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971500}}, [4] = 10, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Secure a trading agreement from Aldous Penhallow of the Merchants' Exchange in the Undercity's Trade Quarter and another from Lucan Ashgrove of the Sepulcher at the Gallows' End, recruit two caravan guards (ask Executor Zygand for a Deathguard; Bastian Coyle waits at the yard), and choose with Dren Hollow which road takes Brill's first caravan. Then bring the route maps to Quartermaster Irena Sable."}, [10] = {{{971542, "The Merchants' Exchange's agreement"}, {971543, "The Sepulcher's agreement"}, {971544, "Caravan guards recruited"}, {971545, "The first caravan's road chosen"}}}, [13] = {971502}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971504] = {[1] = "The First Departure", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971500}}, [4] = 10, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Load Brill's first wagon with its 3 chalk-marked crates and check its harness and wheels, brief its guards Garth Molt and Bastian Coyle, kill 4 Hedge Ambushers on the Undercity road ahead of it, and have the delivery receipt signed by Roadwarden Silas Hobb at the crossroads. Then return to Quartermaster Irena Sable."}, [10] = {{{971546, "Wagon loaded and inspected"}, {971547, "Garth and Bastian briefed"}, {971514, ""}, {971548, "Delivery receipt signed at the crossroads"}}}, [13] = {971503}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971505] = {[1] = "Brill Deliveries", [2] = {{971501}}, [3] = {{971501}}, [4] = 10, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Deliver the caravan office's parcels to Innkeeper Renee at the Gallows' End, Apothecary Johaan and Hamlin Atkins in Brill, then return to Quartermaster Irena Sable."}, [10] = {{{971549, "Parcel signed for by Innkeeper Renee"}, {971550, "Parcel signed for by Apothecary Johaan"}, {971551, "Parcel signed for by Hamlin Atkins"}}}, [13] = {971504}, [17] = 85, [23] = 4096, [24] = 1}, [971506] = {[1] = "Somewhere to Stay", [2] = {{971528}}, [3] = {{971528}}, [4] = 10, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Ask Magistrate Sevren to enter Wenna Dask on Brill's rolls and ask Hamlin Atkins whether he could use a hand, then return to Wenna at the Wayfarer's Rest."}, [10] = {{{971552, "Magistrate Sevren asked"}, {971553, "Hamlin Atkins asked"}}}, [13] = {971504}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971600] = {[1] = "The Kegs Are Empty", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971600}}, [4] = 10, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Look into the old brewhouse beside the Gallows' End, clear 6 piles of spoiled brewing stores from its yard, kill 6 Brewhouse Rats nesting by the cellar hatch behind it and find Oren's old brewing ledger. Then bring it to Brewmaster Oren Blackbarrel."}, [10] = {{{971617, "The old brewhouse looked into"}, {971618, "Piles of spoiled stores cleared"}, {971605, ""}, {971619, "Oren's brewing ledger found"}}}, [13] = nil, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971601] = {[1] = "A Proper Fermentation", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971602}}, [4] = 10, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Salvage copper tubing from the goblins' junked pump below the zeppelin tower west of Brill, 6 sound oak staves from the rotten casks behind the brewhouse and iron hoops from Oliver Dwor by Brill's smithy, then help Bram Lusk repair the 2 fermentation vats and assemble the 3 storage casks in the brewhouse yard."}, [10] = {{{971620, "Copper tubing salvaged"}, {971621, "Sound oak staves"}, {971622, "Iron hoops from Oliver Dwor"}, {971623, "Vats repaired and casks assembled"}}}, [13] = {971600}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971602] = {[1] = "Taste of the Living", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971603}}, [4] = 10, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Gather 4 bitterroot on the hillside west of Brill, a fungal culture from Hamlin Atkins and brewing grain from William Saldean by the smithy; set Calla Fenn's 3 experimental batches going in the brewhouse yard, have Hamlin Atkins, Deathguard Dillinger and Executor Zygand taste them, and choose which recipe Oren should refine. Then return to Calla."}, [10] = {{{971624, "Ingredients gathered"}, {971625, "Experimental batches set going"}, {971626, "Townspeople who tasted the batches"}, {971627, "A recipe chosen for Oren"}}}, [13] = {971601}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971603] = {[1] = "A Bitter Batch", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971600}}, [4] = 10, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Examine the 3 spoiled barrels behind the brewhouse, question Bram Lusk and Calla Fenn, go down through the cellar hatch and cut out the 3 growths in the brewhouse's back wall, and repair the cellar's vent. Then report to Brewmaster Oren Blackbarrel."}, [10] = {{{971628, "Spoiled barrels examined"}, {971629, "Bram and Calla questioned"}, {971630, "Cellar searched and growths cut out"}, {971631, "Cellar vent repaired"}}}, [13] = {971602}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971604] = {[1] = "To Absent Friends", [2] = {}, [3] = {{971600}}, [4] = 10, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Invite Innkeeper Renee of the Gallows' End and Marta Greaves of the Wayfarer's Rest to the opening, tap the 3 sample barrels at Brill's market, help Calla set up the tasting room in the brewhouse yard, and name the brewery's signature drink with Brewmaster Oren Blackbarrel."}, [10] = {{{971632, "Invitations delivered"}, {971633, "Sample barrels tapped at the market"}, {971634, "Tasting room set up"}, {971635, "Signature drink named"}}}, [13] = {971603}, [17] = 85, [23] = 0, [24] = 0}, [971605] = {[1] = "Brewer's Special", [2] = {{971601}}, [3] = {{971601}}, [4] = 10, [6] = 0, [7] = 0, [8] = {"Cut 3 bitterroot on the hillside west of Brill, then pour this week's experimental brew for Innkeeper Renee, Deathguard Burgess and Hamlin Atkins and bring their verdicts to Brewmaster Oren Blackbarrel."}, [10] = {{{971636, "Fresh bitterroot cut"}, {971637, "Innkeeper Renee's verdict"}, {971638, "Deathguard Burgess's verdict"}, {971639, "Hamlin Atkins's verdict"}}}, [13] = {971604}, [17] = 85, [23] = 32768, [24] = 1}}
